<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 634.34, up 4.28.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.10.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 306 to 204.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 16,743,150 compared with 24,706,880 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1330 EST/1730 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
</text>
